13
00:01:07,660 --> 00:01:14,094
Babylonian and Greek astronomers had
already found the trick: 19 solar years

14
00:01:14,094 --> 00:01:20,910
equal almost exactly 235 lunar months. The
Moon needs 235 phase cycles against the

15
00:01:20,910 --> 00:01:27,401
Sun, plus Earth's own 19 orbits, to return
to the same place against the stars.

16
00:01:27,893 --> 00:01:34,839
How do you turn the fraction 254 over 19
into bronze? You cannot easily cut a

17
00:01:34,839 --> 00:01:41,976
single 254-tooth wheel. Instead, the
designer factored 254 into 2 times the

18
00:01:41,976 --> 00:01:47,628
