across three axles.

19
00:01:48,127 --> 00:01:55,693
Watch the exact train inside Fragment A:
the 64-tooth drive wheel b2 turns a

20
00:01:55,693 --> 00:02:03,657
38-tooth gear c1; c2 with 48 teeth drives
d1 with 24; and d2 with 127 teeth drives

21
00:02:03,657 --> 00:02:06,786
