34
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:17,712
Below it sits the Saros eclipse predictor.
An eclipse only happens when a New or Full

35
00:03:17,712 --> 00:03:22,689
Moon aligns with the tilted node of the
Moon's orbit. Every 223 lunar

36
00:03:22,689 --> 00:03:28,396
