40
00:03:46,527 --> 00:03:52,267
Yet the mechanism's deepest triumph lies
tucked at the back of Fragment A. Because

41
00:03:52,267 --> 00:03:57,389
the Moon's orbit is elliptical, it speeds
up near perigee and slows down near

42
00:03:57,389 --> 00:04:01,684
